WEBVTT

01:32.760 --> 01:34.400
I, Ji Yingying,
representing the Ji family,

01:34.480 --> 01:36.920
present our brocade,
"The Return of Phoenix"!

01:37.000 --> 01:38.360
Please evaluate it, everyone.

01:40.960 --> 01:43.000
- Ji Yingying! The Return of Phoenix!
- Ji Yingying! The Return of Phoenix!

01:43.080 --> 01:47.000
Ji Yingying! The Return of Phoenix!

01:47.080 --> 01:48.960
Ji Yingying! The Return of Phoenix!

01:49.040 --> 01:50.480
If I'm not mistaken,

01:51.000 --> 01:52.360
the Ji family isn't allowed to compete.

01:52.440 --> 01:54.040
How can the descendant of a criminal

01:54.120 --> 01:55.600
participate
in the Brocade Weaving Competition?

01:56.680 --> 01:58.320
Ms. Ji doesn't qualify for the contest

01:58.960 --> 02:00.480
and even disrupts the event.

02:02.000 --> 02:03.480
Mr. Yang, don't you do something about it?

02:03.560 --> 02:04.720
Mrs. Zhao,

02:05.240 --> 02:07.880
this matter
is truly beyond my jurisdiction.

02:07.960 --> 02:09.560
If I'm not mistaken,

02:09.639 --> 02:12.400
they were pardoned.

02:12.480 --> 02:14.080
Even His Majesty has pardoned them.

02:14.160 --> 02:17.600
But, Mrs. Zhao,
do you think the pardon is unwarranted?

02:17.680 --> 02:19.200
I didn't say that.

02:20.160 --> 02:21.160
However,

02:21.240 --> 02:22.880
this competition
is about brocade paintings,

02:22.960 --> 02:25.280
and she's competing with a kite.

02:25.360 --> 02:26.320
What a joke!

02:27.040 --> 02:29.520
The art of Shu is born of the heart.

02:30.040 --> 02:33.280
This kite made of Shu Red Silk
is my inner vision.

02:34.600 --> 02:37.760
It was woven by my brother's hands,
reflecting his thoughts.

02:39.240 --> 02:40.720
The Brocade Bureau hasn't stipulated

02:40.800 --> 02:43.320
what a brocade painting must look like.

02:44.000 --> 02:45.600
I weave it out of my thoughts.

02:45.680 --> 02:46.760
What's wrong with that?

02:46.840 --> 02:47.800
- Exactly!
- Exactly!

02:47.880 --> 02:49.320
- Exactly!
- What's wrong with that?

02:49.400 --> 02:50.520
Mr. Yang,

02:51.280 --> 02:53.360
Ji Yingying forged Shu Red Silk

02:53.960 --> 02:55.800
right under everyone's noses.

02:56.320 --> 02:57.560
What a shocking crime!

02:59.240 --> 03:01.320
Tell me, how should this be handled?

03:04.320 --> 03:08.120
This Shu Red kite is vivid and striking.

03:08.200 --> 03:09.480
It doesn't seem fake to me.

03:11.680 --> 03:13.760
Mr. Yang, have you forgotten

03:14.280 --> 03:15.960
that the genuine Shu Red Silk

03:16.040 --> 03:18.160
was already sent to Chang'an by you

03:18.240 --> 03:19.320
and presented to His Majesty?

03:22.720 --> 03:23.560
Ms. Ji,

03:24.200 --> 03:26.040
Previously, the Zhao family
claimed to have Shu Red Silk,

03:26.640 --> 03:28.960
and now your Ji family
is claiming the same.

03:29.600 --> 03:31.720
It makes me confused.

03:32.320 --> 03:34.400
How about you evaluate

03:34.480 --> 03:36.480
which one is real on behalf of me?

03:41.080 --> 03:42.880
- Come on!
- Come on!

03:49.280 --> 03:50.120
Yingying,

03:51.360 --> 03:52.760
the brocade we conceived,

03:53.840 --> 03:55.040
I've woven it.

04:02.880 --> 04:04.560
Who says women can't brave the storm

04:04.640 --> 04:06.480
or hold their heads high?

04:06.560 --> 04:08.640
Soaring to the skies,

04:09.160 --> 04:10.440
isn't this

04:10.520 --> 04:11.360
your image in my heart?

04:23.280 --> 04:24.400
Ji Yingying,

04:24.480 --> 04:26.680
even if you have grievances
with the Zhao family,

04:26.760 --> 04:28.640
you shouldn't vent your anger
by ruining the brocade painting!

04:28.720 --> 04:31.240
Whether it's a masterpiece or a fraud

04:31.320 --> 04:33.080
will soon be clear.

04:33.800 --> 04:34.760
Mrs. Zhao,

04:35.760 --> 04:36.840
stay calm.

04:44.520 --> 04:46.040
It's fading!

04:46.120 --> 04:47.360
The color is fading!

04:47.440 --> 04:48.880
- It's losing color!
- It's fake!

04:48.960 --> 04:50.880
It's truly fake!

04:50.960 --> 04:52.080
As expected, Yingying!

04:52.160 --> 04:53.200
It's fake!

04:54.800 --> 04:57.320
- It's fake!
- It's fake!

05:00.440 --> 05:02.480
- It's fake!
- It's truly fake!

05:04.480 --> 05:06.520
I distinctly remember

05:06.600 --> 05:08.680
it was a masterpiece
that showcased soaring ambitions.

05:08.760 --> 05:10.000
But now, how has it become

05:10.080 --> 05:11.200
a fall from grace?

05:12.800 --> 05:14.520
- A fall from grace!
- A fall from grace!

05:20.240 --> 05:22.800
This brocade painting
is unrecognizable now

05:32.000 --> 05:34.840
because it was woven with Zhao Red Silk.

05:34.920 --> 05:37.640
Zhao Red Silk is not Shu Red Silk.

05:38.160 --> 05:41.920
On that day,
someone coated the red silk with oil,

05:42.000 --> 05:44.760
so it wouldn't completely fade
in alkaline water.

05:45.960 --> 05:48.400
But just now, I used soapberry water,

05:48.480 --> 05:50.000
and the oil dissolved in contact with it.

05:50.080 --> 05:51.520
The fake

05:51.600 --> 05:52.800
naturally revealed its true form.

05:54.880 --> 05:56.280
Ji Yingying!

05:56.360 --> 05:58.680
Ji Yingying! Shu Red Silk!

05:58.760 --> 06:00.840
Ji Yingying! Shu Red Silk!

06:00.920 --> 06:02.920
Ji Yingying! Shu Red Silk!

06:03.000 --> 06:05.320
Ji Yingying! Shu Red Silk!

06:05.400 --> 06:07.480
Ji Yingying! Shu Red Silk!

06:07.560 --> 06:10.240
On that day,
all of you, in front of General Niu,

06:10.320 --> 06:13.600
admitted with your own words

06:14.120 --> 06:15.480
that the Zhao family's silk

06:15.560 --> 06:17.200
was authentic Shu Red Silk.

06:17.280 --> 06:18.480
So,

06:19.000 --> 06:21.280
today, are you trying to deny it?

06:23.720 --> 06:24.880
But…

06:30.760 --> 06:32.160
Now that the results are out,

06:32.760 --> 06:36.080
please announce
this year's Brocade Master.

06:39.320 --> 06:40.640
This year,

06:41.560 --> 06:45.320
the Brocade Master of the competition is…

06:47.640 --> 06:49.080
Zhao Xiuyuan

06:49.160 --> 06:50.800
from the Zhao family.

06:53.920 --> 06:55.760
Ms. Ji didn't hear it clearly.

06:55.840 --> 06:57.800
Please speak louder.

07:00.320 --> 07:01.240
This year,

07:01.840 --> 07:03.880
the Brocade Master of the competition

07:03.960 --> 07:05.840
is Zhao Xiuyuan!

07:11.440 --> 07:13.200
- What?
- Are you kidding?

07:24.360 --> 07:27.360
Since Lady Niu has spoken

07:27.440 --> 07:28.560
and the Brocade Master has been decided,

07:30.840 --> 07:31.960
I'll take my leave.

07:38.040 --> 07:39.480
Our Shu Red phoenix

07:40.240 --> 07:41.680
will find another home!

07:42.880 --> 07:45.080
- Let's go.
- This kind of competition is not worth it!

07:45.160 --> 07:46.000
- Exactly, let's leave!
- Let's go.

07:46.080 --> 07:47.840
What a waste of time!

08:01.080 --> 08:02.200
Yaoting,

08:02.280 --> 08:03.440
from today onward,

08:03.520 --> 08:06.680
everyone will know that our Ji family
can make Shu Red Silk again.

08:25.040 --> 08:27.400
You deliberately let Ji Yingying
ruin Shu Red Silk.

08:28.480 --> 08:29.680
Mr. Yang,

08:29.760 --> 08:31.160
do you no longer value your life?

08:32.840 --> 08:34.520
Madam, you're joking.

08:35.480 --> 08:37.120
When the real Shu Red Silk appears,

08:37.200 --> 08:39.520
the fake one will naturally be exposed.

08:40.120 --> 08:42.640
Besides, in front of so many people,

08:42.720 --> 08:45.800
how could I make anything up?

08:47.720 --> 08:48.720
Don't forget

08:49.320 --> 08:51.680
that the Zhao Red Silk was sent by you
to Chang'an.

08:52.480 --> 08:53.680
If this silk is fake,

08:53.760 --> 08:55.680
you will be the first to be questioned.

08:55.760 --> 08:57.480
I haven't forgotten.

08:57.560 --> 09:00.760
Indeed, the Zhao Red Silk
was sent to Chang'an by me,

09:01.360 --> 09:02.600
but it was never presented at the palace.

09:04.920 --> 09:06.720
If you don't believe it,

09:06.800 --> 09:09.240
you can go to Chang'an
and investigate yourself.

09:10.960 --> 09:11.880
You've kept a backup plan.

09:14.120 --> 09:16.000
As Brocade Officer,

09:16.080 --> 09:17.680
the position is full of dangers,

09:17.760 --> 09:19.640
so I must always leave a way out.

09:20.240 --> 09:21.520
Regardless,

09:21.600 --> 09:22.960
today's competition

09:23.040 --> 09:24.720
still sees the Zhao family as the victor.

09:25.240 --> 09:28.800
I've even prepared a gift for you, madam.

09:30.880 --> 09:32.760
Mr. Yang, bad news!

09:34.560 --> 09:35.640
Mount Qingcheng is on fire!

09:38.800 --> 09:40.240
Mount Qingcheng is on fire.

09:40.320 --> 09:41.320
Madam,

09:41.400 --> 09:42.880
would you like to join me

09:42.960 --> 09:44.440
and head up the mountain together?

09:46.360 --> 09:49.640
The Zhao family has already prepared
a celebration banquet at San Hua Pavilion.

09:49.720 --> 09:51.320
They should be waiting for me now.

09:52.520 --> 09:53.560
As for the trouble on Mount Qingcheng,

09:54.400 --> 09:56.000
you will handle it on your own.

09:57.520 --> 09:59.240
From earlier until now,

09:59.320 --> 10:01.520
I haven't seen your maid, Yu Yuan.

10:02.400 --> 10:04.360
I wonder where she could be at the moment.

10:05.080 --> 10:07.960
If she's up on Mount Qingcheng,

10:08.480 --> 10:10.400
she might be in danger.

10:21.240 --> 10:23.400
- Hurry, put out the fire!
- Hurry!

10:23.480 --> 10:25.320
- Water is here!
- Water is here!

10:26.120 --> 10:27.040
Quickly!

10:27.120 --> 10:28.560
Hurry up!

10:30.080 --> 10:31.800
Who did this?

10:31.880 --> 10:33.080
Why did this happen?

10:33.160 --> 10:34.760
There's a cave over there!

10:36.200 --> 10:37.440
Slow down!

10:37.520 --> 10:38.600
You little rascal!

10:38.680 --> 10:39.760
We can't go slower, Father!

10:39.840 --> 10:41.760
Yang Jinglan said
there's a big opportunity up there.

10:41.840 --> 10:43.200
We can't let others beat us to it!

10:44.240 --> 10:45.520
Yang Jinglan?

10:47.040 --> 10:48.960
Hurry up, Father!

10:49.040 --> 10:49.880
Take a few extra steps!

10:49.960 --> 10:51.160
Why not use a horse?

10:51.240 --> 10:52.400
You'll have to tough it out for now…

11:02.960 --> 11:04.920
What are you doing?

11:07.880 --> 11:10.680
Chief Sang is here!
The Imperial Uncle is here!

11:10.760 --> 11:12.520
Why are you shouting that?

11:13.880 --> 11:15.560
Chief Sang, look at this!

11:15.640 --> 11:18.400
Who could commit such an outrageous act?

11:18.480 --> 11:19.840
What…

11:19.920 --> 11:20.840
What is going on?

11:20.920 --> 11:22.720
How could there be
a brocade workshop here?

11:23.240 --> 11:24.720
Does the fire here

11:24.800 --> 11:26.120
have anything to do with you?

11:27.920 --> 11:28.760
Chief Sang,

11:28.840 --> 11:30.520
these people have been poisoned mute.

11:30.600 --> 11:31.800
They can't speak at all.

11:31.880 --> 11:34.200
It's clear that they were kept here

11:34.280 --> 11:35.720
as forced labor.

11:35.800 --> 11:36.640
Oh…

11:36.720 --> 11:37.640
Rest assured.

11:37.720 --> 11:39.960
If there's any suffering, any grievance,
write it down.

11:40.040 --> 11:42.040
My father will ensure justice
for everyone!

11:42.120 --> 11:43.080
You…

11:44.280 --> 11:46.240
So, this is the big opportunity
you mentioned?

11:46.320 --> 11:47.840
Do you want me dead or something?

11:47.920 --> 11:49.200
Don't you think this is serious?

11:50.560 --> 11:54.560
Who would dare to kidnap civilians

11:54.640 --> 11:56.040
to profit from brocade-making?

12:00.120 --> 12:00.960
Chief Sang.

12:01.040 --> 12:02.120
Yang Jinglan.

12:02.640 --> 12:06.560
I've just discovered
this terrible operation as well.

12:06.640 --> 12:08.720
I trust you will unearth

12:08.800 --> 12:11.360
the culprit behind this and show no mercy,

12:11.440 --> 12:13.160
bringing justice to everyone!

12:13.240 --> 12:15.880
- Great!
- Great!

12:17.440 --> 12:18.800
Yes…

12:18.880 --> 12:21.800
I will absolutely bring justice to all.

12:22.760 --> 12:23.600
Guards,

12:24.120 --> 12:26.160
search the brocade workshop
and nearby caves.

12:26.240 --> 12:27.400
Find the mastermind behind this!

12:27.480 --> 12:28.680
- Search now!
- Yes, sir!

12:30.680 --> 12:32.320
This is fake Shu Red Silk! This is called…

12:32.400 --> 12:33.240
Zhao Red Silk!

12:35.200 --> 12:36.560
Put it down!

12:37.240 --> 12:38.400
This is…

12:38.480 --> 12:39.760
imperial yellow silk!

12:39.840 --> 12:41.720
They're planning a rebellion, Father!
A rebellion!

12:41.800 --> 12:43.320
Shut up!

12:45.040 --> 12:45.960
I…

12:54.160 --> 12:55.000
Mr. Yang,

12:55.080 --> 12:57.600
we found a young woman in the cave,
along with these people.

12:57.680 --> 12:59.640
They must be connected
to this illegal brocade workshop.

13:02.240 --> 13:03.520
Chief Sang, come on.

13:05.120 --> 13:06.840
Let me introduce someone to you.

13:07.360 --> 13:10.320
This is Yu Yuan, Niu Wuniang's maid.

13:10.960 --> 13:12.120
Since she's here,

13:12.200 --> 13:13.600
it proves that this matter

13:13.680 --> 13:15.040
is deeply connected

13:15.120 --> 13:16.520
to Niu Wuniang.

13:16.600 --> 13:17.760
Exactly, that's a good point.

13:17.840 --> 13:19.000
Nonsense!

13:22.920 --> 13:23.960
Madam!

13:29.560 --> 13:30.880
How could you be here?

13:30.960 --> 13:32.840
Didn't I send you to pray on the mountain?

13:36.080 --> 13:36.960
Madam,

13:37.480 --> 13:39.360
a group of bandits suddenly appeared

13:39.440 --> 13:40.880
and captured me here.

13:41.400 --> 13:43.440
I have no idea what happened.

13:44.480 --> 13:46.800
Madam, let's leave now.

13:47.320 --> 13:48.160
I'm scared.

13:49.440 --> 13:51.000
It seems this brocade workshop
in the mountains

13:51.080 --> 13:52.720
was indeed the work of bandits.

13:53.840 --> 13:56.600
Thanks for finding my maid, Mr. Yang.

13:57.440 --> 13:58.680
Yu Yuan, let's go.

13:59.200 --> 14:00.040
Wait.

14:01.840 --> 14:03.560
If they are bandits,

14:04.080 --> 14:05.440
then how come your maid

14:05.520 --> 14:07.960
was captured along with them?

14:12.920 --> 14:14.960
You should ask them.

14:15.040 --> 14:16.560
Why question me?

14:17.600 --> 14:20.280
Perhaps they are fiercely loyal, or maybe

14:20.360 --> 14:21.320
their loved ones' lives

14:22.200 --> 14:23.800
are being held hostage,

14:23.880 --> 14:25.880
leaving them unable to speak the truth.

14:28.320 --> 14:30.040
If they cannot speak,

14:30.120 --> 14:31.360
what does that have to do with me?

14:32.240 --> 14:33.600
If they won't speak,

14:33.680 --> 14:34.520
then I will.

14:36.280 --> 14:37.120
Yingying!

14:45.240 --> 14:46.440
Father…

14:49.000 --> 14:50.240
I, Ji Yingying,

14:50.320 --> 14:52.160
accuse Niu Wuniang

14:52.840 --> 14:54.800
of producing fake Shu Red Silk,
building an illegal brocade workshop,

14:54.880 --> 14:56.160
causing chaos in the industry,

14:56.240 --> 14:57.480
and stealing my family's honor.

14:57.560 --> 14:59.920
Daring to frame the family of an official,
what crime does that warrant?

15:00.000 --> 15:01.520
Who gave you the right to speak?

15:04.000 --> 15:05.040
Get up.

15:06.320 --> 15:07.400
Thank you, Chief Sang.

15:09.280 --> 15:10.120
Ms. Ji,

15:10.200 --> 15:11.960
do you have any evidence?

15:12.040 --> 15:13.160
At today's Brocade Competition,

15:13.240 --> 15:15.280
everyone saw with their own eyes

15:15.360 --> 15:17.920
that the fake Shu Red Silk
faded in alkaline water.

15:18.000 --> 15:20.960
Shu Red Silk
is a designated royal request,

15:21.040 --> 15:23.960
and Niu Wuniang dared to fake it publicly.

15:24.040 --> 15:25.720
This is a grave act of disrespect!

15:26.320 --> 15:28.640
Ms. Ji, you must be mistaken.

15:29.400 --> 15:31.760
The Zhao Red Silk was dyed by my husband.

15:32.440 --> 15:33.680
If you want to press charges,

15:33.760 --> 15:35.240
you should accuse him instead.

15:37.240 --> 15:38.920
You two are truly

15:39.000 --> 15:41.040
the closest yet most distant couple.

15:43.400 --> 15:44.600
Ms. Ji,

15:45.120 --> 15:48.400
the Zhao Red Silk was dyed
by Zhao Xiuyuan.

15:48.480 --> 15:51.120
Are you accusing the wrong person?

15:51.200 --> 15:52.080
No.

15:52.160 --> 15:54.440
The person I am accusing
is none other than her,

15:54.520 --> 15:56.280
Niu Wuniang!

15:57.000 --> 15:58.120
I have a witness.

16:10.920 --> 16:12.360
Why is he here?

16:17.800 --> 16:18.640
I'm Hua Xiangrong

16:18.720 --> 16:21.400
from the Hua's Dyehouse.

16:21.480 --> 16:22.920
Greetings, Chief Sang.

16:26.600 --> 16:28.080
I can testify

16:29.960 --> 16:31.480
that Niu Wuniang

16:31.560 --> 16:33.600
is the mastermind
behind the fake Shu Red Silk!

16:35.840 --> 16:37.040
It was she

16:38.000 --> 16:39.280
who ordered me

16:40.440 --> 16:43.040
and my late wife

16:43.120 --> 16:44.520
to produce fake Shu Red Silk.

16:45.360 --> 16:46.840
Before the threads were even spun,

16:47.640 --> 16:50.720
she urged us to pass it off as genuine.

16:52.160 --> 16:53.840
As for these workers,

16:54.360 --> 16:55.880
it was she who ordered me

16:55.960 --> 16:57.200
to kidnap and deceive them here

16:57.280 --> 16:59.120
using the guise of recruitment.

17:01.160 --> 17:02.640
Even my wife…

17:04.480 --> 17:06.119
was killed because of her!

17:07.079 --> 17:08.200
Miss Ji,

17:08.720 --> 17:10.640
if you intend to frame me,

17:10.720 --> 17:12.160
you should at least
find an upstanding citizen.

17:13.319 --> 17:16.440
The Hua family has always been guilty
of tax evasion.

17:17.599 --> 17:18.800
How can his words

17:18.880 --> 17:20.000
be trusted?

17:20.079 --> 17:21.440
I have evidence!

17:26.000 --> 17:27.040
Do you think

17:28.160 --> 17:30.600
seizing all our account books

17:30.680 --> 17:32.160
would make everything fine?

17:33.720 --> 17:35.200
My wife foresaw

17:35.760 --> 17:38.760
that she was dealing with
a cruel and ruthless person.

17:39.680 --> 17:41.680
So, she made duplicates
of all the account books.

17:45.600 --> 17:46.760
Hua Xiangrong!

17:48.840 --> 17:50.080
I spent 20 years

17:51.520 --> 17:53.520
with my wife.

17:54.240 --> 17:56.000
Our bond is unbreakable!

17:58.240 --> 18:00.080
I know I'm doomed,

18:00.960 --> 18:02.320
and I fear death,

18:03.160 --> 18:04.480
but what I fear more

18:05.040 --> 18:07.120
is my wife

18:07.200 --> 18:08.560
being unable to rest in peace!

18:14.760 --> 18:15.720
I know

18:16.240 --> 18:17.920
that we're both guilty as charged,

18:19.520 --> 18:20.480
but still…

18:21.680 --> 18:23.040
don't think you'll get away with it.

18:25.280 --> 18:27.200
Even if I have to give my life,

18:27.280 --> 18:29.160
I will avenge my wife!

18:36.320 --> 18:37.960
I have contracts

18:38.040 --> 18:39.360
and account books as evidence.

18:39.440 --> 18:40.520
Please, Chief Sang, take a look!

18:42.960 --> 18:44.080
Father!

18:44.600 --> 18:46.160
Father! Father!

18:46.240 --> 18:47.040
SILK TRANSPORT LEDGER ON MOUNTAIN

18:47.120 --> 18:48.800
Father, look!

18:48.880 --> 18:49.880
Quick, look!

18:57.520 --> 19:00.160
Oh… um… Mrs. Niu,

19:00.680 --> 19:04.040
what do you expect me to do now?

19:04.120 --> 19:06.640
Chief Sang, you're the local magistrate.

19:06.720 --> 19:08.680
It's natural for you
to handle this fairly.

19:08.760 --> 19:10.880
Moreover, everyone is watching.

19:10.960 --> 19:12.640
Exactly, Father!

19:13.320 --> 19:14.600
Everyone is watching!

19:14.680 --> 19:15.760
I was involved

19:16.280 --> 19:18.000
in Niu Wuniang's crimes.

19:18.080 --> 19:19.320
I acknowledge my guilt!

19:19.920 --> 19:22.280
But Niu Wuniang's crimes are far worse!

19:23.880 --> 19:26.120
Please, Chief Sang, deliver justice!

19:27.400 --> 19:28.880
Father!

19:28.960 --> 19:31.560
Faking Shu Red Silk, taking lives,

19:31.640 --> 19:33.120
kidnapping craftsmen…

19:34.000 --> 19:37.160
These are grave crimes,
terrible beyond words.

19:37.800 --> 19:38.960
Chief Sang,

19:40.200 --> 19:43.080
- why haven't you acted yet?
- Of course, we'll act. Father!

19:43.160 --> 19:44.240
Chief Sang,

19:44.760 --> 19:46.480
do you dare make an arrest?

19:48.280 --> 19:49.480
Well…

19:50.320 --> 19:52.360
To arrest or not to arrest,
that is a question…

19:52.440 --> 19:53.960
Arrest them, Father!

19:54.040 --> 19:55.640
Or how will you face these craftsmen

19:55.720 --> 19:56.640
and these common people?

19:57.280 --> 19:59.120
- Arrest them!
- Arrest them! Arrest them!

19:59.200 --> 20:02.200
Arrest them! Arrest them!

20:06.600 --> 20:08.360
Arrest them!

20:08.440 --> 20:09.480
- Well…
- Arrest them!

20:09.560 --> 20:11.480
Then… we'll arrest them…

20:14.160 --> 20:15.880
Let's see who dares to make the arrest!

20:31.280 --> 20:32.320
Father.

20:38.240 --> 20:39.280
General Niu,

20:40.160 --> 20:41.600
Hua Xiangrong confessed the truth

20:41.680 --> 20:43.080
and provided testimony,

20:43.160 --> 20:44.600
yet you killed him.

20:45.120 --> 20:46.680
Are you trying to shield Niu Wuniang?

20:47.520 --> 20:49.640
Get rid of these onlookers.

20:49.720 --> 20:50.920
Yes, sir.

20:51.000 --> 20:52.680
General Niu,
you may drive the people away,

20:52.760 --> 20:53.960
but today's events

20:54.040 --> 20:55.760
will spread throughout the city.

20:55.840 --> 20:57.200
You can't silence public opinion!

20:58.400 --> 20:59.840
Look at this mess of yours…

20:59.920 --> 21:02.360
I'll clean it up for you only this time.

21:02.440 --> 21:03.680
Fire the arrows!

21:18.480 --> 21:19.560
Niu Jin,

21:21.080 --> 21:22.600
you abuse your power

21:22.680 --> 21:24.200
and kill the innocent.

21:24.280 --> 21:25.880
How could you ignore your morals
and the law?

21:30.640 --> 21:31.480
Oh…

21:32.440 --> 21:35.720
General Niu, don't kid about that!

21:38.400 --> 21:39.800
Yang Jinglan,

21:40.680 --> 21:42.320
are we going to die here today?

21:42.960 --> 21:43.920
I promised you

21:44.800 --> 21:46.280
I'd protect you.

21:46.360 --> 21:48.480
My elder sister… She's the Empress,

21:48.560 --> 21:49.640
the Empress of this dynasty!

21:49.720 --> 21:51.080
You… How dare you!

21:52.840 --> 21:54.720
Blame those who dragged you into this.

21:56.040 --> 21:58.440
Today, only your silence

21:58.520 --> 22:00.960
will ensure that no one knows this secret

22:01.600 --> 22:04.280
or questions morality or law.

22:19.560 --> 22:20.560
The Governor is here!

22:21.600 --> 22:23.680
- He's here.
- General Niu!

22:23.760 --> 22:25.760
General Niu! General Niu!

22:26.360 --> 22:27.960
Let go of me.

22:28.040 --> 22:29.680
General Niu, hold on.

22:30.440 --> 22:32.040
General Niu, hold on.

22:34.160 --> 22:35.120
An order from the Military Commissioner:

22:42.880 --> 22:44.520
The Emperor's birthday is approaching.

22:45.280 --> 22:47.560
With deep reverence for His Majesty,

22:47.640 --> 22:49.200
the Military Commissioner
commands the Brocade Officer

22:49.800 --> 22:53.880
to oversee the creation of Shu Red Silk,

22:53.960 --> 22:56.080
woven jointly by Ji Yingying,
the inheritor of Shu Red,

22:56.720 --> 22:58.280
and the new Brocade Master.

22:58.360 --> 23:00.480
No one is permitted to interfere!

23:03.080 --> 23:05.160
I accept the order!

23:10.800 --> 23:11.640
General Niu,

23:11.720 --> 23:13.840
perhaps it's time

23:13.920 --> 23:15.600
to lower your bows.

23:15.680 --> 23:17.720
A fire broke out in the mountains.

23:17.800 --> 23:19.480
Mr. Yang and Chief Sang,

23:20.280 --> 23:22.960
concerned for the people,
went to extinguish it

23:23.040 --> 23:25.640
but unfortunately perished.

23:26.360 --> 23:31.560
Afterward, Governor Zhang
heroically put out the fire,

23:32.200 --> 23:33.560
earning the gratitude of the people.

23:33.640 --> 23:34.520
However,

23:34.600 --> 23:39.280
the Military Commissioner's order
remains unheard.

23:40.240 --> 23:41.680
Doesn't that sound better?

23:49.120 --> 23:51.520
General Niu,

23:51.600 --> 23:53.640
I wished I could have arrived late today.

23:54.200 --> 23:55.680
But think it over.

23:56.600 --> 23:59.200
How did the Military Commissioner
know the inheritor of Shu Red

23:59.280 --> 24:00.480
was Ji Yingying

24:00.560 --> 24:02.800
and not the Mr. Zhao?

24:03.320 --> 24:05.760
Had I arrived late today,

24:06.760 --> 24:09.320
my life would have ended.

24:09.400 --> 24:10.520
But General Niu,

24:10.600 --> 24:12.400
it would have been
an even greater disaster

24:12.960 --> 24:14.600
for you facing the Military Commissioner.

24:14.680 --> 24:16.640
You prepared early

24:16.720 --> 24:18.440
and acted covertly.

24:19.160 --> 24:21.400
Well played, Mr. Yang.

24:21.480 --> 24:22.720
Fine.

24:23.240 --> 24:26.840
Since the Military Commissioner
commands you to oversee the weaving,

24:26.920 --> 24:29.480
make sure nothing goes wrong.

24:29.560 --> 24:31.400
Otherwise,
no one will be able to save you.

24:33.040 --> 24:34.680
No need to trouble you, General Niu.

24:34.760 --> 24:36.040
Let's hope so.

24:37.160 --> 24:38.000
Let's go!

24:47.600 --> 24:50.000
Father, that was terrifying!

24:50.720 --> 24:52.760
I thought we were done for!

24:52.840 --> 24:53.960
Look at you,

24:54.040 --> 24:55.640
you little rascal!

24:55.720 --> 24:57.800
If you dare fool around
with reckless people again,

24:57.880 --> 24:59.520
I'll break your legs!

25:14.120 --> 25:16.520
Today, I've seen it firsthand

25:17.200 --> 25:19.600
how they twist truth

25:20.440 --> 25:22.600
and wield unchecked power.

25:39.800 --> 25:42.120
Does the Military Commissioner
truly allow Niu Jin

25:42.920 --> 25:44.320
to amass wealth

25:44.840 --> 25:46.120
and disregard human life?

25:49.600 --> 25:51.560
Niu Jin acted on his own
without informing him.

25:52.720 --> 25:53.680
He will surely face criticism.

25:54.640 --> 25:57.320
But after all,
Niu Jin is still his soldier.

25:57.400 --> 25:58.760
As long as it's not rebellion,

25:59.280 --> 26:01.280
he'll turn a blind eye to it.

26:02.000 --> 26:04.800
What about Chang'an?
Will Chang'an intervene?

26:06.360 --> 26:07.760
Some people want to do it,

26:08.840 --> 26:10.240
but it's not easy.

26:11.400 --> 26:14.080
The court and the border states
are intricately connected.

26:18.280 --> 26:19.200
Rest assured.

26:20.280 --> 26:21.920
With the Military Commissioner's order,

26:22.560 --> 26:25.560
Niu Jin won't dare openly arrest you.

26:28.080 --> 26:29.480
Even if he dares,

26:30.160 --> 26:31.600
I won't let him succeed.

26:35.120 --> 26:36.240
What about you?

26:37.360 --> 26:39.200
Will they target you in secret?

26:39.280 --> 26:41.560
That depends on them.

26:42.480 --> 26:43.440
But whether I survive or not

26:43.520 --> 26:45.000
depends on me.

26:45.800 --> 26:47.200
Yang Jinglan,

26:48.480 --> 26:49.840
are you afraid?

26:51.400 --> 26:52.400
Are you afraid?

26:57.280 --> 26:58.680
I won't regret it,

26:59.600 --> 27:01.240
and I won't back down.

27:05.280 --> 27:06.520
I am afraid,

27:08.640 --> 27:10.560
but that's not necessarily a bad thing.

27:11.320 --> 27:13.920
Fear can remind me to run faster,

27:14.760 --> 27:16.480
to avoid the same fate.

27:21.880 --> 27:22.920
I'm afraid too,

27:26.080 --> 27:27.720
afraid of letting down the dead,

27:29.280 --> 27:30.720
afraid of failing

27:30.800 --> 27:31.960
to protect the living.

27:36.080 --> 27:37.560
But if you stay afraid,

27:38.560 --> 27:39.880
you won't run fast enough.

28:09.880 --> 28:11.520
Do you want me to go inside with you

28:11.600 --> 28:12.720
and explain everything to your mother?

28:14.520 --> 28:15.720
My mother probably won't want anyone

28:15.800 --> 28:18.040
to see her disciplining her child
with a stick.

28:34.960 --> 28:36.160
Miss.

28:36.240 --> 28:37.560
Is she using the ruler or the bamboo cane?

29:03.320 --> 29:05.920
BELOVED HUSBAND
JI GUINAN'S MEMORIAL TABLET

29:15.040 --> 29:16.480
Mother, it's my fault.

29:16.560 --> 29:18.520
I told Yaoting to hide it from you.

29:18.600 --> 29:20.640
No. I wove that Shu Red Silk kite.

29:20.720 --> 29:22.520
I told Yingying not to tell you.

29:22.600 --> 29:23.840
Yaoting has always indulged
and spoiled me.

29:23.920 --> 29:25.920
No, it's my fault
for failing as an elder brother.

29:26.000 --> 29:27.040
What did your father

29:28.000 --> 29:29.760
really die for?

29:31.280 --> 29:32.520
Why was our family accused?

29:40.920 --> 29:42.280
It was because

29:43.320 --> 29:45.000
of Shu Red Silk.

29:45.760 --> 29:48.920
But Father would never have forged it.
Father…

29:49.000 --> 29:50.200
On the day you were pardoned and released,

29:50.960 --> 29:52.360
what did you both promise me?

29:59.880 --> 30:01.680
Ji Yingying, say it.

30:03.480 --> 30:05.640
That we would never
bring up Father's case again

30:05.720 --> 30:06.680
and live our lives in peace.

30:09.560 --> 30:12.640
But Mother, even if we don't resist today,

30:12.720 --> 30:14.640
- can we really remain safe?
- Yingying.

30:16.880 --> 30:19.360
A tiger eats humans because it's hungry.

30:19.440 --> 30:21.440
It won't spare someone
just because they're obedient.

30:21.520 --> 30:22.480
Yingying!

30:23.080 --> 30:25.160
Mother,
Yingying only wanted to prevent others

30:25.240 --> 30:26.800
from misusing the Father's reputation
and the Shu Red Silk.

30:26.880 --> 30:28.400
She didn't mention the old case.

30:29.600 --> 30:30.560
Ji Yingying,

30:31.680 --> 30:32.840
didn't you?

30:34.040 --> 30:35.800
Have you never thought
about bringing it up?

30:37.160 --> 30:38.320
All these years,

30:38.400 --> 30:40.080
you've forced yourself to dye red.

30:40.760 --> 30:42.800
Was it really
just to support the dyehouse?

30:44.200 --> 30:45.120
Mother,

30:46.000 --> 30:48.720
can you bear to see Father carry the shame

30:49.240 --> 30:50.480
and suffer injustice for life?

30:58.000 --> 31:00.440
What is the first rule
of our brocade workshop?

31:01.200 --> 31:02.360
Recite it.

31:04.920 --> 31:06.240
Recite it loudly!

31:12.080 --> 31:13.480
In the Ji family's brocade workshop,

31:14.000 --> 31:16.240
brocade comes first,
but human life is above brocade.

31:16.320 --> 31:17.480
What does that mean?

31:18.800 --> 31:19.960
In the Ji family's brocade workshop,

31:20.040 --> 31:21.880
all things prioritize brocade weaving.

31:22.400 --> 31:25.160
Right and wrong, grudges and fame…
All come after.

31:25.240 --> 31:27.440
Only human life is above brocade.

31:28.960 --> 31:30.120
In times of disaster,

31:30.200 --> 31:31.960
save people first, then the brocade.

31:32.480 --> 31:35.560
A person's life outweighs
the workshop's gains and losses.

31:36.160 --> 31:38.320
Good. Very good.

31:39.840 --> 31:42.840
What does it mean
that a person's life outweighs everything?

31:43.440 --> 31:44.600
Tell your father.

31:45.640 --> 31:47.720
What does it mean?

31:52.480 --> 31:54.920
If your father were alive today,

31:55.000 --> 31:56.320
what would he truly care about?

31:56.400 --> 31:58.160
His reputation

31:58.240 --> 31:59.960
or the safety of his children?

32:00.040 --> 32:02.520
Father's love for us surpasses everything.

32:02.600 --> 32:03.880
He would understand me.

32:03.960 --> 32:05.720
He would allow me to do whatever I want.

32:05.800 --> 32:08.080
It seems he really did spoil you

32:08.160 --> 32:09.520
to the point where now,

32:09.600 --> 32:11.320
you refuse to admit fault!

32:19.200 --> 32:21.600
Mother, I was wrong.

32:21.680 --> 32:23.320
I shouldn't have hidden this from you.

32:23.400 --> 32:24.440
I shouldn't have upset you.

32:27.240 --> 32:30.800
But… one can endure temporarily,
bide their time,

32:30.880 --> 32:33.360
but one cannot endure forever
and lose their spirit.

32:34.600 --> 32:37.520
The justice I seek,
I will claim for myself.

32:37.600 --> 32:39.320
For everything I did today,

32:39.920 --> 32:40.960
I have no regrets.

32:44.040 --> 32:45.720
- You…
- Mother!

32:47.560 --> 32:48.880
- Mother!
- Mother!

32:48.960 --> 32:49.960
Let go!

33:01.080 --> 33:02.160
Ji Yingying,

33:03.360 --> 33:04.400
you're quite something.

33:06.120 --> 33:08.640
It's me, as your mother,
who failed to teach you well.

33:10.240 --> 33:11.840
The one who needs to reflect

33:11.920 --> 33:14.400
isn't you, but me.

33:29.760 --> 33:32.600
Mother must be utterly disappointed in me
to act this way, right?

33:35.400 --> 33:37.160
Mother isn't heartless.

33:38.720 --> 33:40.480
When Father passed away suddenly
back then,

33:41.320 --> 33:42.640
you were afraid of dyeing red,

33:43.160 --> 33:44.640
and I was trapped in the brocade workshop.

33:46.280 --> 33:48.960
Mother has her own unresolved grief too.

33:50.600 --> 33:53.320
She's simply terrified
of losing either of us.

33:54.840 --> 33:56.920
That's why I don't want
to hide from her anymore.

33:58.680 --> 33:59.800
Yaoting,

34:01.240 --> 34:02.880
only by facing the past

34:03.480 --> 34:05.240
can we move beyond it.

34:15.960 --> 34:19.639
NIU RESIDENCE

34:22.520 --> 34:24.840
I've always pitied your hardships.

34:25.440 --> 34:28.560
You have a love for small gains,
and I've always turned a blind eye.

34:28.639 --> 34:31.400
I never expected you to grow so bold,

34:31.480 --> 34:33.400
daring to build
an illegal brocade workshop.

34:33.480 --> 34:35.199
Perhaps I've indulged you too much!

34:35.280 --> 34:38.320
General, there's no need for this.

34:38.400 --> 34:40.320
She's just a young woman.

34:40.960 --> 34:43.040
Why make things worse for her?

34:44.920 --> 34:46.520
Aren't you going to thank Governor Zhang?

34:48.679 --> 34:50.239
Thank you, Governor.

34:50.320 --> 34:53.560
This matter arises entirely
from my foolish greed.

34:53.639 --> 34:55.400
It has nothing to do with my father.

34:56.120 --> 34:58.200
I beg you to discern the truth

34:58.280 --> 35:00.480
and not ruin my father's name,

35:01.000 --> 35:02.440
nor disgrace the Military Commissioner.

35:05.560 --> 35:08.280
What does this have to do
with the Military Commissioner?

35:08.360 --> 35:10.040
I am my father's daughter.

35:10.560 --> 35:14.440
In the eyes of the world, what I do
is seen as what my father has done.

35:15.120 --> 35:17.880
Father is a trusted general
under the Military Commissioner.

35:17.960 --> 35:21.400
If my father is involved,
it reflects on the Military Commissioner.

35:21.920 --> 35:23.640
The world doesn't care about the truth.

35:23.720 --> 35:25.440
They only speculate maliciously.

35:26.120 --> 35:27.680
If my actions drag down

35:27.760 --> 35:30.120
my father and the Military Commissioner,

35:30.200 --> 35:32.280
it would be an irreparable injustice!

35:36.400 --> 35:41.320
I see now why you favor her, General.

35:42.160 --> 35:44.720
She always likes to act clever.

35:44.800 --> 35:47.600
This is just her excuse
to have you cover up her mistakes.

35:49.840 --> 35:52.960
However, she has a point.

35:54.520 --> 35:57.320
If I claim
to have no knowledge of this matter,

35:57.920 --> 35:59.360
let alone anyone else,

35:59.440 --> 36:01.520
even you, Governor, would you believe it?

36:04.160 --> 36:05.640
I also know full well

36:05.720 --> 36:08.680
that you're not involved in this.

36:08.760 --> 36:11.160
But will the Military Commissioner
believe it?

36:11.800 --> 36:14.760
Will he think
that you and I are complicit?

36:19.560 --> 36:21.040
General, you must be joking.

36:22.400 --> 36:25.280
The Military Commissioner,

36:25.360 --> 36:27.320
though stationed with the army year-round,

36:27.840 --> 36:28.920
is fully aware of the city's affairs.

36:30.200 --> 36:31.680
He would not wrong you.

36:35.200 --> 36:36.480
And what about the court?

36:37.520 --> 36:40.320
How much does the court know about Yizhou

36:41.040 --> 36:41.960
or the Military Commissioner?

36:42.960 --> 36:45.360
If the Brocade Officer
sends evidence of this matter

36:45.440 --> 36:46.720
to the court,

36:46.800 --> 36:49.960
it's inevitable that someone
with ill intentions will twist the facts

36:50.040 --> 36:51.120
to slander the Military Commissioner.

36:51.640 --> 36:53.360
To be honest,

36:54.000 --> 36:56.120
I value my reputation.

36:56.200 --> 36:59.440
My forceful actions in the mountains today
had personal motives,

36:59.520 --> 37:01.080
but this is the root cause of it all.

37:04.440 --> 37:05.920
You have deep foresight.

37:06.600 --> 37:10.000
I trust the Military Commissioner
will understand.

37:10.880 --> 37:14.200
The Military Commissioner holds you
in high regard.

37:15.120 --> 37:18.560
Yizhou City is just as much yours.

37:18.640 --> 37:19.840
We are all one family,

37:20.440 --> 37:23.800
so it's fair for your daughter
to want a share.

37:23.880 --> 37:25.600
But, General,

37:25.680 --> 37:27.720
why keep it
from the Military Commissioner?

37:27.800 --> 37:31.520
This is where
you've drawn unnecessary lines.

37:33.560 --> 37:34.840
I understand now.

37:35.360 --> 37:36.600
From now on,

37:37.120 --> 37:41.120
I will report everything
to the Military Commissioner.

37:42.720 --> 37:44.040
Thank you for your guidance.

37:44.120 --> 37:45.400
You're too kind.

37:45.480 --> 37:46.480
Guards.

37:59.560 --> 38:01.000
General, you're too generous.

38:01.080 --> 38:03.040
I am unworthy of such praise.

38:03.880 --> 38:05.320
Rest assured, General.

38:05.400 --> 38:07.920
Today's events will simply be recorded
as a mountain fire,

38:08.000 --> 38:09.200
nothing more.

38:09.760 --> 38:10.920
I'll take my leave.

38:31.400 --> 38:33.040
Since the Governor has spoken this way,

38:33.120 --> 38:35.640
it seems the Military Commissioner
still trusts you.

38:37.320 --> 38:39.280
This time, I underestimated my opponent.

38:39.360 --> 38:41.120
Father, please give me another chance.

38:41.200 --> 38:42.720
I will definitely find evidence
against Yang Jinglan.

38:49.240 --> 38:51.120
You are now married into the Zhao family,

38:51.200 --> 38:53.960
so focus on being a proper wife.

38:54.640 --> 38:56.960
Fulfill your role as a household woman.

38:57.800 --> 38:59.800
As for other matters,
don't meddle in them.

39:00.640 --> 39:04.000
Father, Yang Jinglan easily solved

39:04.080 --> 39:06.080
the issue of the fake Shu Red Silk
being sent to Chang'an.

39:06.160 --> 39:08.120
The forces behind him
must be extraordinary.

39:08.200 --> 39:09.280
Don't you want to know?

39:10.040 --> 39:12.320
Rather than using spies in Chang'an,
why not…

39:17.280 --> 39:18.640
If my daughter,

39:18.720 --> 39:20.920
overwhelmed by shame,
were to take her own life,

39:23.280 --> 39:25.120
do you think the Military Commissioner

39:25.200 --> 39:29.160
would trust and sympathize with me
even more?

39:33.080 --> 39:34.280
Father,

39:34.360 --> 39:35.840
there will always be those

39:35.920 --> 39:37.040
who suspect you

39:37.600 --> 39:40.360
of being ruthless and silencing me.

39:54.880 --> 39:57.240
Madam! Madam, are you alright?

40:00.880 --> 40:01.960
Just now,

40:03.080 --> 40:06.120
he truly intended to kill me…

40:07.160 --> 40:08.120
Madam…

40:26.240 --> 40:29.080
Please forgive me, General.
I arrived late.

40:30.120 --> 40:30.960
How about this?

40:32.080 --> 40:33.760
I'll first punish myself with a drink.

40:38.720 --> 40:40.640
Do you know why I invited you here?

40:46.720 --> 40:48.040
Today in the mountains,

40:48.120 --> 40:50.160
you nearly took my life.

40:50.680 --> 40:51.720
And now, tonight,

40:51.800 --> 40:54.160
you've invited me here yourself.

40:55.200 --> 40:56.440
Could it be

40:56.960 --> 40:58.720
you weren't satisfied with the killings
on the mountain

40:58.800 --> 41:00.080
and set another trap?

41:01.840 --> 41:04.440
You knew it was a trap and still came?

41:04.520 --> 41:06.720
Mr. Yang, you are bold indeed.

41:07.240 --> 41:10.680
Do you know
why I chose to invite you here?

41:13.040 --> 41:15.840
General, your rank is esteemed,
your experience vast.

41:15.920 --> 41:18.520
It seems this isn't merely

41:18.600 --> 41:22.000
an invitation for fine wine
and delicacies.

41:22.920 --> 41:24.280
This restaurant's setting

41:24.800 --> 41:25.880
is truly exceptional?

41:28.280 --> 41:30.320
Mr. Yang, you're as sharp as ever.

41:31.560 --> 41:33.000
Everyone else, leave now.

41:40.560 --> 41:41.960
What I value

41:42.040 --> 41:44.000
is the exquisite view here.

42:00.120 --> 42:03.600
I've spent years fighting battles
in the army,

42:04.320 --> 42:06.560
always practicing force before courtesy.

42:07.520 --> 42:09.800
Only when my enemies are cornered

42:09.880 --> 42:11.280
can negotiations begin.

42:12.280 --> 42:13.360
How generous is your courtesy?

42:13.440 --> 42:16.280
It depends on what the people behind you

42:16.800 --> 42:17.640
are aiming for.

42:19.360 --> 42:20.760
I am but a lone man,

42:20.840 --> 42:22.000
with no one behind me.

42:24.320 --> 42:26.120
That incapable fool

42:26.200 --> 42:29.600
threatened you to send Zhao Red Silk
to the Crown Prince,

42:30.320 --> 42:33.640
yet the Prince ultimately
didn't present the silk to the Empress.

42:35.080 --> 42:37.120
To influence the Crown Prince's decisions

42:37.200 --> 42:39.200
without leaving a trace…

42:39.800 --> 42:43.400
the people behind you are truly powerful.

42:44.600 --> 42:46.960
Perhaps the Crown Prince himself felt

42:47.040 --> 42:50.200
the item wasn't grand enough
and decided to replace it.
